      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "There are already options in world creation to do this with the Far Clip Plane and Culling. Any world that is actually well made and has an author that knows what they're doing already has this set up. Things you can't see aren't rendering.\nOf course if the author of the world you're in doesn't know what they hell they're doing they made has messed it up or added like tons of real time lights without baking them and have shadows enabled on all of them and didn't set up culling properly and added shaders or extremely expensive skybox textures that are all eating your frames.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
