  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-02-19T06:48:59.801Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "We have personal space which makes anyone very close to you invisible. This is a nice idea for those with issues with physical contact, even if virtual. However, we could use this concept to help make rooms with 40+ people less laggy. Instead of \"oh hide everyone's avatars (and usually never unhide them later)\" why not make it so they won't render past a user-specified distance. Nametags should still render but avatars could just become invisible like they do for personal space mode. They will reappear once again if they come closer.",
